This is an unofficial fan-made mod for GTFO. It is not made, endorsed or supported by 10 Chambers Collective.
GTFO and its game data belong to their owners; no file taken from the game is included in this package.

Third-party material in this package: none.
Everything in the zip is Forge's own work: the assemblies built from this repository, the probe and command files under probes/, the helper scripts
under tools/, manifest.json, icon.png and the documentation. The package is compiled against BepInEx, HarmonyX, Il2CppInterop, GTFO-API, Iced,
Mono.Cecil, MonoMod and the game's interop assemblies; they are installed separately as the dependencies named in manifest.json or come with the
BepInEx loader, and none of them is included here.